  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malaria Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zento will support the NMCPs established malaria strategy by advancing progress toward meeting the programs entomological goals for the 2021-2025 period. NMCPs concern with entomology, the scientific study of insects, is to monitor and understand the behavior of mosquitoes that contribute to the transmission of malaria.</narrative>
  </description>
